❗️ The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continue to launch group strikes against logistics centres, port infrastructure facilities of Ukraine, and maritime vessels operating in the interests of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

💥  During the day, long-range attack drones hit:

📍a logistics centre where dual-purpose goods and military equipment were stored and distributed in the settlement of Brovary of Kiev region;

📍a logistics centre involved in providing the Armed Forces of Ukraine with military equipment in the city of Nikolayev;

📍in Odessa region:

▪️a concentration area of heavy trucks, used to provide the AFU's units with ammunition and materiel in the settlement of Dachnoye;

▪️a dry cargo ship with military hardware supplied to the AFU by Western countries in the port of Chernomorsk.

💥  In addition, a dry cargo ship and a tanker with UAV production components, ammunition, and fuel for the Armed Forces of Ukraine was hit in the Black Sea waters east of Odessa.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

